  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><ul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-small\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 18px;color:rgb(15,17,17);padding:0px;font-family:'Amazon Ember', Arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;\"><li style=\"list-style:disc;margin:0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item a-size-base a-color-base\" style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(15,17,17);\">Lightweight Defense Armor: Rynoskin Total is designed with a special blend of fabric that protects you from harmful bites and UV rays outdoors. The patented weaving pattern is completely noise proof and can be worn under any outdoor clothing, camping accessory or hunting gear</span></li><li style=\"list-style:disc;margin:0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item a-size-base a-color-base\" style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(15,17,17);\">Total Protection: Rynoskin Total offers protection from head to toe. Our gloves, hood, socks, pants, and shirt are most-effectively worn as base layers and are well suited for hunting, camping, hiking, fishing, or any outdoor activity. With a variety of colors to choose from, our garments can match your gear. We also have a special line of Mossy Oak camouflage to keep you well hidden and can be worn under ghillie suits or camo netting with no additional efforts</span></li><li style=\"list-style:disc;margin:0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item a-size-base a-color-base\" style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(15,17,17);\">UV PROTECTION : We understand the long hours spent outdoors in sun hunting, fishing, camping, hiking or simply moving your lawn, the kind of damage it can have on your skin. Rynoskin base layer is all you need to shield yourself from the ruthless sun and have those extended hours outdoors.</span></li><li style=\"list-style:disc;margin:0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item a-size-base a-color-base\" style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(15,17,17);\">CHEMICAL FREE: Unlike many insect protection clothes, our line is not treated with harmful chemicals and emit no smell which can compromise your hiding spot. This allows you to avoid any sticky &amp; messy repellent creams to help you deal with the insects &amp; bugs in wild. Light, breathable, sweat-wicking fabric keeps you cool. Our clothes are machine wash and tumble dry and require no special care.</span></li><li style=\"list-style:disc;margin:0px;\"><span class=\"a-list-item a-size-base a-color-base\" style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:20px;color:rgb(15,17,17);\">Patented, Tested, Proven: Rynoskin Total is made of a proprietary blend of lycra and spandex fabric which feels smooth and makes no noise. The stitching and fabric combination allows for flexibility and stretch while still maintaining a solid barrier against biting insects. Special cuffs help our products grip your body and keep crawling insects OUT (especially ticks). Patented and tested in the lab and proven effective for over 20 years in the field. </span></li></ul></div></div>",
